      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cedar_Key%2C_Florida",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cedar Key became the western terminus of the Florida Railroad in 1860, linking it to Fernandina Beach on the east coast.",
